<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(1.4 PROCESS OF CREATING THE PLAN)/E(1.4 PROCESS OF CREATING THE PLAN)/Pg 13 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

589 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(The comprehensive planning process for the Town of Candor was an extensive and interactive endeavor, beginning with an initial site visit. This step involved exploring the village and town, laying the groundwork for a deep understanding of the local context.)/E(The comprehensive planning process for the Town of Candor was an extensive and interactive endeavor, beginning with an initial site visit. This step involved exploring the village and town, laying the groundwork for a deep understanding of the local context.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

590 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Following the site visit, a key element of our approach was the distribution of a resident questionnaire. This survey, sent via mail postcards, was rich with open-ended questions, allowing Candor residents to share detailed insights and experiences. Their responses provided a genuine reflection of life in Candor, highlighting what they value and need in their community.)/E(Following the site visit, a key element of our approach was the distribution of a resident questionnaire. This survey, sent via mail postcards, was rich with open-ended questions, allowing Candor residents to share detailed insights and experiences. Their responses provided a genuine reflection of life in Candor, highlighting what they value and need in their community.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

591 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 454 0 R/Pg 13 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

592 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(To further foster community engagement and awareness, a second event was organized during the Fall Festival. This community engagement initiative was critical in raising awareness about the planning activities and encouraging residents to participate in the survey.)/E(To further foster community engagement and awareness, a second event was organized during the Fall Festival. This community engagement initiative was critical in raising awareness about the planning activities and encouraging residents to participate in the survey.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

593 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Once the responses were gathered, the Design Connect team embarked on a meticulous process of sorting and analyzing the feedback. We categorized the residents' input into themes and problem statements, which revealed the residents' priorities and needs. )/E(Once the responses were gathered, the Design Connect team embarked on a meticulous process of sorting and analyzing the feedback. We categorized the residents' input into themes and problem statements, which revealed the residents' priorities and needs. )/Pg 13 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

594 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(These themes and problem statements then guided the drafting of the comprehensive plan. Our recommendations, aimed at steering the town planning board, were directly influenced by the residents' feedback. This ensured that the final plan not only addresses current issues but also aligns with the aspirations and requirements of the Candor community, paving the way for a future that best serves its residents.)/E(These themes and problem statements then guided the drafting of the comprehensive plan. Our recommendations, aimed at steering the town planning board, were directly influenced by the residents' feedback. This ensured that the final plan not only addresses current issues but also aligns with the aspirations and requirements of the Candor community, paving the way for a future that best serves its residents.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

595 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(TOWN OF CANDOR - COMPREHENSIVE PLAN)/Pg 13 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

