644 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T( The Town of Candor\220s population has gradually increased in the past 50 years with an increase of about ~900 people. However, the population in the town has fluctuated based on decades, from the 2010 census, there is a reported population decrease from 5,305 residents to 2020\220s 5,149. Further, the Census Bureau predicts a continuous decrease in population. For 2022, there is an estimated population of 2.94% decrease.       )/E( The Town of Candor\220s population has gradually increased in the past 50 years with an increase of about ~900 people. However, the population in the town has fluctuated based on decades, from the 2010 census, there is a reported population decrease from 5,305 residents to 2020\220s 5,149. Further, the Census Bureau predicts a continuous decrease in population. For 2022, there is an estimated population of 2.94% decrease.       )/Pg 16 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

645 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T(In general, there is an observed population decline within Tioga County. The projected county population decrease from the Cornell Program on Applied Demographics predicts that there will be a linear constant reduction in population of around 2,651 residents in the next 10 years. In the past 20 years, the county has not experienced any positive net migration rate. Following the rough projections, it is suggested that there will be a decrease in the Candor town population in the next 10 years following the county trend.)/E(In general, there is an observed population decline within Tioga County. The projected county population decrease from the Cornell Program on Applied Demographics predicts that there will be a linear constant reduction in population of around 2,651 residents in the next 10 years. In the past 20 years, the county has not experienced any positive net migration rate. Following the rough projections, it is suggested that there will be a decrease in the Candor town population in the next 10 years following the county trend.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

646 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(TOWN OF CANDOR - COMPREHENSIVE PLAN)/Pg 16 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

