endobj

649 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T( Other than Tioga County, New York\220s Southern Tier counties are among the state\220s leaders in population loss. The only upstate counties with population gains from 2010 to 2017 were Rensselaer, Schenectady, Ontario, Tompkins, Monroe, Albany Erie, and Saratoga. )/E( Other than Tioga County, New York\220s Southern Tier counties are among the state\220s leaders in population loss. The only upstate counties with population gains from 2010 to 2017 were Rensselaer, Schenectady, Ontario, Tompkins, Monroe, Albany Erie, and Saratoga. )/Pg 17 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

