677 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(Higher Civic Awareness: Students and families gain a better understanding of local government functions. Increased Civic Participation: The initiative encourages future involvement and leadership in civic activities. Stronger Community Connections: The partnership fosters closer ties between families, schools, and the government. Inclusive Decision-Making: Broader community engagement leads to more diverse and representative governance. Long-Term Engagement: Focused on youth and families, the initiative aims to cultivate sustained interest in local governance.)/E(Higher Civic Awareness: Students and families gain a better understanding of local government functions. Increased Civic Participation: The initiative encourages future involvement and leadership in civic activities. Stronger Community Connections: The partnership fosters closer ties between families, schools, and the government. Inclusive Decision-Making: Broader community engagement leads to more diverse and representative governance. Long-Term Engagement: Focused on youth and families, the initiative aims to cultivate sustained interest in local governance.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

