endobj

681 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(Land Use and Buildings)/E(Land Use and Buildings)/Pg 21 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

682 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(4.1 EXISTING CONDITIONS)/E(4.1 EXISTING CONDITIONS)/Pg 21 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

683 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T(When it comes to determining the best strategies for Candor\220s future development, understanding the existing land use patterns are vital to inform and ensure Candor\220s continued economic success. With an overwhelming presence of residential, recreational, and rural uses, the pastoral and agricultural character of Candor can be clearly seen in its development patterns. Similarly, the distinct lack of commercial parcels are also perhaps demonstrative of future goals for Candor. Regardless, Candor\220s community presents a unique personality in their pursuit of maintaining their rural character. )/E(When it comes to determining the best strategies for Candor\220s future development, understanding the existing land use patterns are vital to inform and ensure Candor\220s continued economic success. With an overwhelming presence of residential, recreational, and rural uses, the pastoral and agricultural character of Candor can be clearly seen in its development patterns. Similarly, the distinct lack of commercial parcels are also perhaps demonstrative of future goals for Candor. Regardless, Candor\220s community presents a unique personality in their pursuit of maintaining their rural character. )/Pg 21 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

684 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(4.1.1 EXISTING LEGISLATION )/E(4.1.1 EXISTING LEGISLATION )/Pg 21 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

685 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T(Candor does not currently possess a set of zoning guidelines. Furthermore, there has been significant opposition within the community to the potential implementation of such restrictions on private development. Nonetheless, Candor does possess a series of land use and building laws governing subdivisions, mobile homes, roads, signage, etc., of which the relevant legislation will be mentioned in brief here:)/E(Candor does not currently possess a set of zoning guidelines. Furthermore, there has been significant opposition within the community to the potential implementation of such restrictions on private development. Nonetheless, Candor does possess a series of land use and building laws governing subdivisions, mobile homes, roads, signage, etc., of which the relevant legislation will be mentioned in brief here:)/Pg 21 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

686 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(-The Subdivision Regulation of 1990- Defines a subdivision as well as the various conformities that it must abide by regarding roads, sidewalks, utilities, public spaces, and rules governing cluster developments.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

687 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(-The Manufactured Home Law of 2017 -)/Pg 21 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

688 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Provides for regulations on manufactured home developments akin to those provided for mobile homes in Candor, such as minimum lot size, setbacks, and parking.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

689 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(-Site Plan Review Law of 2019-)/Pg 21 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

690 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Mandates site plan reviews for all new land use activity to be submitted and approved by the town planning board. The law also requires that all developments provide a Site Plan Checklist. Of note here are additional requirements for telecommunications and solar developments, as well as restrictions on development of adult businesses.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

691 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(-Mobile Home Park Regulations of 1994- )/Pg 21 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

692 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(specifies a broad series of requirements for mobile home parks, including minimum construction standards for mobile homes and requirements for mobile home park siteing, such as but not limited to road access, minimum clearance, open space, and available parking spaces. The law also specifies that all mobile homes must possess valid permits and licenses issued by the town and be subject to regular inspections.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

693 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/T(TOWN OF CANDOR - COMPREHENSIVE PLAN)/E(TOWN OF CANDOR - COMPREHENSIVE PLAN)/Pg 21 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

694 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(14)/Pg 21 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

695 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/T(-Numbering of Buildings Law of 1993-  Mandates that all buildings in the Town of Candor \(exempting the Village of Candor\) display assigned building numbers fronting any street. The law provides for a standardized scheme for numbering, regulations on the display of numbering and the maintenance of said numbering by building owners, and tasks the Fire Department with canvassing building numbers when required.)/E(-Numbering of Buildings Law of 1993-  Mandates that all buildings in the Town of Candor \(exempting the Village of Candor\) display assigned building numbers fronting any street. The law provides for a standardized scheme for numbering, regulations on the display of numbering and the maintenance of said numbering by building owners, and tasks the Fire Department with canvassing building numbers when required.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

696 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/T(-The Seasonal Roads Use Law of 2021- Regulates the issuance of building permits for any structure on seasonal use roads which may not provide 12-month access for fire and other emergency vehicles, including regulations defining and requiring the adherence of Type U requirements. The law also defines the permitting requirements, including the application, certification, and enforcement of seasonal road usage by the Town Council. )/E(-The Seasonal Roads Use Law of 2021- Regulates the issuance of building permits for any structure on seasonal use roads which may not provide 12-month access for fire and other emergency vehicles, including regulations defining and requiring the adherence of Type U requirements. The law also defines the permitting requirements, including the application, certification, and enforcement of seasonal road usage by the Town Council. )/Pg 22 0 R/K[5]>>
