777 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(The land use classifications for the land use map and table were created based on the 20 most prevalent divisions. Each distinct land use was then categorized based on which category they fit in best. It is important to note that the percentages within the land use tables were calculated based on the total number of parcels in Candor \(2,980\) and their classification. The tables are not a representation of the size of the land being used or physical space within Candor.   )/E(The land use classifications for the land use map and table were created based on the 20 most prevalent divisions. Each distinct land use was then categorized based on which category they fit in best. It is important to note that the percentages within the land use tables were calculated based on the total number of parcels in Candor \(2,980\) and their classification. The tables are not a representation of the size of the land being used or physical space within Candor.   )/Pg 23 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

778 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Data Source: NYSGIS, 2023)/E(Data Source: NYSGIS, 2023)/Pg 23 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

779 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(The three categories with the most prevalent land use within Candor are residential with 1,379 parcels, mixed use areas with 328 parcels, and vacant lots with 862. An overwhelming majority of residential spaces in Candor \(83.76%\) and nearly 40% of all uses within Candor are single family residences. A large majority of the defined mixed use spaces fall under the \215Rural Residential w/ Recreation\216 section, containing 82% of mixed uses and 9% of Candor as a whole.   )/E(The three categories with the most prevalent land use within Candor are residential with 1,379 parcels, mixed use areas with 328 parcels, and vacant lots with 862. An overwhelming majority of residential spaces in Candor \(83.76%\) and nearly 40% of all uses within Candor are single family residences. A large majority of the defined mixed use spaces fall under the \215Rural Residential w/ Recreation\216 section, containing 82% of mixed uses and 9% of Candor as a whole.   )/Pg 23 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

780 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 464 0 R/Pg 23 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

781 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 464 0 R/Pg 23 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

782 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Data Source: NYSGIS, 2023)/E(Data Source: NYSGIS, 2023)/Pg 23 0 R/K[21]>>
endobj

