821 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/T(The economy of the Town consists of a variety of sectors that provide Candor with employment and a majority of its tax base, such as education, health, social services, manufacturing, construction, commercial, retail, finance, agriculture, forestry, mining, fishing, and information technology. The primary entities responsible for economic development in the Town are the Candor Chamber of Commerce and the Candor Planning Board, with cooperation with the Village regarding shared services.)/E(The economy of the Town consists of a variety of sectors that provide Candor with employment and a majority of its tax base, such as education, health, social services, manufacturing, construction, commercial, retail, finance, agriculture, forestry, mining, fishing, and information technology. The primary entities responsible for economic development in the Town are the Candor Chamber of Commerce and the Candor Planning Board, with cooperation with the Village regarding shared services.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

