823 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T(5.1.1.1 LABOR PARTICIPATION RATE & EMPLOYMENT RATE)/E(5.1.1.1 LABOR PARTICIPATION RATE & EMPLOYMENT RATE)/Pg 28 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

824 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/T(With a national average labor participation rate at 62.6%, and the New York State average at 58.6%, the labor participation rate in Candor town maintained a relatively high level for the past decade. The labor participation experienced a slight decline from 64.2% to 62.2% from 2012 to 2014 and then steadily increased to 69.2% before the pandemic. The pandemic resulted in a sharp drop to 59.3% in 2021. However, the unemployment rate of Candor town was higher than the national and state average for most of the past few decades, fluctuating around 7.5% percent. Females above 16 years in Candor town had a lower labor participation rate but a lower employment rate starting in 2014.)/E(With a national average labor participation rate at 62.6%, and the New York State average at 58.6%, the labor participation rate in Candor town maintained a relatively high level for the past decade. The labor participation experienced a slight decline from 64.2% to 62.2% from 2012 to 2014 and then steadily increased to 69.2% before the pandemic. The pandemic resulted in a sharp drop to 59.3% in 2021. However, the unemployment rate of Candor town was higher than the national and state average for most of the past few decades, fluctuating around 7.5% percent. Females above 16 years in Candor town had a lower labor participation rate but a lower employment rate starting in 2014.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

