830 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(The largest proportion of the employed were in the education, health care, and social assistance sectors, with a percentage over 25%, followed by manufacturing and arts, entertainment, recreation and accommodation and food services, both over 10%. However, despite Candor\220s rich agricultural history, the percentage of people in the agriculture, forestry, fishing, hunting, and mining sectors is less than 5%. The percentage remained nearly zero in 2012 and 2013 and only gradually increased from 2014.)/E(The largest proportion of the employed were in the education, health care, and social assistance sectors, with a percentage over 25%, followed by manufacturing and arts, entertainment, recreation and accommodation and food services, both over 10%. However, despite Candor\220s rich agricultural history, the percentage of people in the agriculture, forestry, fishing, hunting, and mining sectors is less than 5%. The percentage remained nearly zero in 2012 and 2013 and only gradually increased from 2014.)/Pg 29 0 R/K[4]>>
