<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(The adjusted median household income in Candor experienced fluctuations from 2012 to 2019, reaching a high of $59,338.65 in 2019. The median household income declined significantly in the next two years. While some of the adjacent counties also experienced a decline in the median household income, these declines were more moderate than that in Candor.)/E(The adjusted median household income in Candor experienced fluctuations from 2012 to 2019, reaching a high of $59,338.65 in 2019. The median household income declined significantly in the next two years. While some of the adjacent counties also experienced a decline in the median household income, these declines were more moderate than that in Candor.)/Pg 31 0 R/K[8]>>
