872 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(Tourism in the Town of Candor is under the jurisdiction of the Candor Chamber of Commerce, with all events listed on their official website. Tourism is also promoted by Tioga County Tourism, although it is not as accurate on the relevance of events and activities as the Candor Chamber of Commerce. Additionally, local newspapers, such as the Owego Pennysaver help to promote Candor events.)/E(Tourism in the Town of Candor is under the jurisdiction of the Candor Chamber of Commerce, with all events listed on their official website. Tourism is also promoted by Tioga County Tourism, although it is not as accurate on the relevance of events and activities as the Candor Chamber of Commerce. Additionally, local newspapers, such as the Owego Pennysaver help to promote Candor events.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[3]>>
