874 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(The Daffodil Festival Sponsored by the Candor Chamber of Commerce, the Daffodil Festival engages with the local community and attracts many from surrounding areas as well. There are many local businesses that sponsor the event, and a portion of the proceeds go to funding the Candor Food Pantry. Originally an event hosted by a resident, this festival hosts nearly 100 vendors and many musical acts, this event helps support and promote small businesses)/E(The Daffodil Festival Sponsored by the Candor Chamber of Commerce, the Daffodil Festival engages with the local community and attracts many from surrounding areas as well. There are many local businesses that sponsor the event, and a portion of the proceeds go to funding the Candor Food Pantry. Originally an event hosted by a resident, this festival hosts nearly 100 vendors and many musical acts, this event helps support and promote small businesses)/Pg 33 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

875 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(The Fall Festival The Fall Festival, also sponsored by the Candor Chamber of Commerce, celebrates the beginning of the fall season, and features live music, vendors, local businesses, and more. Annually, there is the Scarecrow Contest, the promotion of the Town\220s rich history, and the Fall Block Party.)/E(The Fall Festival The Fall Festival, also sponsored by the Candor Chamber of Commerce, celebrates the beginning of the fall season, and features live music, vendors, local businesses, and more. Annually, there is the Scarecrow Contest, the promotion of the Town\220s rich history, and the Fall Block Party.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

876 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(5.1.5 PROJECTIONS)/E(5.1.5 PROJECTIONS)/Pg 33 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

877 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(In the coming years, the labor participation rate and unemployment rate are likely to remain stable, while there may be slight fluctuations. If the trends of the past few years continue, commute times are expected to experience a further decline, in addition to a continued increase in the number of people working from home. The means of transportation to work are likely to remain with the current distribution among transportation types as long as there continues to be no public transportation provided in the town. The distribution of household income is also likely to experience a trend towards having a more even distribution.)/E(In the coming years, the labor participation rate and unemployment rate are likely to remain stable, while there may be slight fluctuations. If the trends of the past few years continue, commute times are expected to experience a further decline, in addition to a continued increase in the number of people working from home. The means of transportation to work are likely to remain with the current distribution among transportation types as long as there continues to be no public transportation provided in the town. The distribution of household income is also likely to experience a trend towards having a more even distribution.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

878 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(The biggest shift in the economy might be the industry structure of employment. There is a trend for an increase in the manufacturing sector and the comparatively shrinking of the service sector, while occupations related to public services, like education and healthcare are likely to retain their status with the most employees.)/E(The biggest shift in the economy might be the industry structure of employment. There is a trend for an increase in the manufacturing sector and the comparatively shrinking of the service sector, while occupations related to public services, like education and healthcare are likely to retain their status with the most employees.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[9]>>
