882 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(Regarding the economy of the Town of Candor, respondents to the town survey have raised many issues. Many responses pointed out the lack of a major employer, and there is a high demand for an increase in the number of and the diversity of local businesses to build a larger tax base and increase easily accessible shopping opportunities. Specifically, a desire for more grocery accessibility was common among the respondents.)/E(Regarding the economy of the Town of Candor, respondents to the town survey have raised many issues. Many responses pointed out the lack of a major employer, and there is a high demand for an increase in the number of and the diversity of local businesses to build a larger tax base and increase easily accessible shopping opportunities. Specifically, a desire for more grocery accessibility was common among the respondents.)/Pg 34 0 R/K[3]>>
