906 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(The creation of a dedicated tourism website is expected to increase the visibility and appeal of Candor as a destination. By highlighting local attractions and activities, the website should draw more visitors to the area, boosting foot traffic and patronage at local businesses. This digital presence will also facilitate easier access to information about Candor, enhancing the overall visitor experience and potentially leading to an increase in tourism-related economic activity in the town.)/E(The creation of a dedicated tourism website is expected to increase the visibility and appeal of Candor as a destination. By highlighting local attractions and activities, the website should draw more visitors to the area, boosting foot traffic and patronage at local businesses. This digital presence will also facilitate easier access to information about Candor, enhancing the overall visitor experience and potentially leading to an increase in tourism-related economic activity in the town.)/Pg 35 0 R/K[11]>>
