<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(By targeting smaller, nonprofit grants and crowdfunding, Candor can increase its chances of securing funding for various projects. This strategy allows for more grant applications, covering a wider range of needs and opportunities. Additionally, crowdfunding efforts are anticipated to enhance community involvement and investment in local projects, fostering a sense of collective responsibility and participation.)/E(By targeting smaller, nonprofit grants and crowdfunding, Candor can increase its chances of securing funding for various projects. This strategy allows for more grant applications, covering a wider range of needs and opportunities. Additionally, crowdfunding efforts are anticipated to enhance community involvement and investment in local projects, fostering a sense of collective responsibility and participation.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[6]>>
