1035 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Fair Housing Ordinance  A Fair Housing Law was passed in 1994 that banned housing discrimination in the Town of Candor. You cannot discriminate against the providing of housing based on race, color, religion, sex, handicap, familial status or national origin. Banks, listing services and brokerages can\220t discriminate on this basis either. However, selling a single family home owner-to-owner is excluded from this ban. )/E(Fair Housing Ordinance  A Fair Housing Law was passed in 1994 that banned housing discrimination in the Town of Candor. You cannot discriminate against the providing of housing based on race, color, religion, sex, handicap, familial status or national origin. Banks, listing services and brokerages can\220t discriminate on this basis either. However, selling a single family home owner-to-owner is excluded from this ban. )/Pg 40 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

