endobj

1072 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(7.1.4.1 PARK DESIGN)/E(7.1.4.1 PARK DESIGN)/Pg 45 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

1073 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(The proposed park design takes into account field survey work, precedent study research, as well as feedback from multiple excursions with the community. From all these sources, the site design was split to include a play space, gathering space, and open space, which include walkways and a picnic area. The park experience is also enhanced with lighting additions, a unique planting selection, and supportive signage. Many of these incorpaortions speak directly to fulfilling the needs of the community such as versatile recreation space for people of all ages, safe walking paths for elderly visitors, play space specifically for youth, as well as general beautification for the community. )/E(The proposed park design takes into account field survey work, precedent study research, as well as feedback from multiple excursions with the community. From all these sources, the site design was split to include a play space, gathering space, and open space, which include walkways and a picnic area. The park experience is also enhanced with lighting additions, a unique planting selection, and supportive signage. Many of these incorpaortions speak directly to fulfilling the needs of the community such as versatile recreation space for people of all ages, safe walking paths for elderly visitors, play space specifically for youth, as well as general beautification for the community. )/Pg 45 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

