<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Highway 96 has an average daily traffic count of 2536 vehicles, 11% of which, or 249 of which, are trucks. The average road speed for the stretch of highway is 55. The averages for highway 96 are calculated from the Main Street of Candor, to Spencer Avenue, to the turnoff onto Straits Corners Road. Resident survey responses suggest a much higher average speed on Candor\220s Main Street.)/E(Highway 96 has an average daily traffic count of 2536 vehicles, 11% of which, or 249 of which, are trucks. The average road speed for the stretch of highway is 55. The averages for highway 96 are calculated from the Main Street of Candor, to Spencer Avenue, to the turnoff onto Straits Corners Road. Resident survey responses suggest a much higher average speed on Candor\220s Main Street.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

1105 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Highway 96B has an average daily traffic count of 4202 vehicles, 6% of which, or 271 of which, are trucks. The average road speed for the stretch of highway is 57. The averages for highway 96B are calculated from Owego Road in Candor all the way north to Ithaca Road. One resident survey response suggested an average speed around 30 on Owego Road due to the lack of a road sign alerting drivers to a speed limit change.)/E(Highway 96B has an average daily traffic count of 4202 vehicles, 6% of which, or 271 of which, are trucks. The average road speed for the stretch of highway is 57. The averages for highway 96B are calculated from Owego Road in Candor all the way north to Ithaca Road. One resident survey response suggested an average speed around 30 on Owego Road due to the lack of a road sign alerting drivers to a speed limit change.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[7]>>
